{"4948000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Moo Who?","steam_appid":4948000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moo Who? is a multiplayer voice-mimicry party game where animal players hide among NPC herds while hunters try to figure out who is fake.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound Like an Animal<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal player must use their microphone to mimic their assigned species.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moo like a cow. Cluck like a chicken. Oink like a pig. Baa like a sheep.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make it believable enough to survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/05a444eeeee7273f12bcdaa21d1b7f37.poster.avif?t=1793043982\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/05a444eeeee7273f12bcdaa21d1b7f37.webm?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/05a444eeeee7273f12bcdaa21d1b7f37.mp4?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don’t Let the Flies Find You<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t hide silently forever.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sound-pressure moment begins, make your animal sound before it is too late. If you fail, buzzing flies will appear around you and make your location easier for hunters to spot.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/3d7c5b21b0a9a193c079a4ebff2aa989.poster.avif?t=1793043982\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/3d7c5b21b0a9a193c079a4ebff2aa989.webm?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/3d7c5b21b0a9a193c079a4ebff2aa989.mp4?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot Only When You’re Sure<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters carry a shotgun, but every shot matters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot the wrong animal and you waste your chance. Shoot the real player and the hunters get closer to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/ebe0ae94c7499ea7b668a57f0eb9139b.poster.avif?t=1793043982\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/ebe0ae94c7499ea7b668a57f0eb9139b.webm?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4948000\/extras\/ebe0ae94c7499ea7b668a57f0eb9139b.mp4?t=1793043982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play With Friends<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with 2–8 players in short, chaotic matches full of panic, suspicion, fake confidence, wrong accusations, and terrible animal sounds.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moo Who? is a multiplayer voice-mimicry party game where animal players hide among NPC herds while hunters try to figure out who is fake.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound Like an Animal<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal player must us